# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 74-79) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# 0.3.7 (Horde 40-60 flow pass): west to east. Salfa -> Donova and the
# Frostfire Hot Springs camps -> Raging Owlbeasts on the road east ->
# Everlook (Umi's yetis, Felnok's chimaeras) -> Winterfall Village -> fly.
# Meggi's Trouble in Winterspring! (6603), a pointer to Donova, is left out.
# The older notes below describe the export's order.
#
# Flow: Everlook (Gregor, Felnok, Harlo, Umi, Meggi) -> Ice Thistle yetis ->
# Chillwind chimaeras -> Everlook -> ride west (Raging Owlbeasts) -> Donova
# Snowden -> Salfa -> Frostfire Winterfall camps -> Salfa -> Donova ->
# Darkwhisper Gorge -> Winterfall Village -> Donova -> Salfa (beads) ->
# hearth to Everlook -> grind to 55 -> Mau'ari -> fly to Camp Mojache
# (Videre Elixir, Talo) -> Thunder Bluff (Morrowgrain, Hamuul, Nara, cloth
# donations, Druid and Paladin training) -> Orgrimmar (bind, cloth
# donations), where the next guide
# starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Umi's and Meggi's quests (3783, 6603) are taken on arrival in Everlook
#   and the yetis done straight away, since their hills are next to town;
#   the export takes them after its first hearth. That first hearth (54.7)
#   becomes a ride: Darkwhisper Gorge and Winterfall Village lie east of
#   Donova anyway.
# - The Desolace stop (visit 77) is dropped: its only "objectives" are the
#   Thunder Bluff cloth donations (7820-7822), which are just cloth carried in
#   your bags. The same goes for the Mageweave donations the export
#   "completes" in Azshara (7831, 7835): every Thunder Bluff and Orgrimmar
#   donation is handed in on the stop that takes it (final review, 0.3.5),
#   so the Azshara guide has no second Orgrimmar stop for them.
# - Binds immediately replaced are dropped (Camp Mojache, Thunder Bluff);
#   the Orgrimmar bind is kept for the hearth at the end.
# - Dropped: In Defense of Frostwolf (7241, a battleground quest); Return to
#   Tinkee (4810: Burning Steppes, never on the later route) and Duke
#   Hydraxis' Poisoned Water and Stormers and Rumblers (6804, 6805: the
#   later guides no longer hand them in, the Duke's chain runs on past 60).
#   A Crew Under Fire (3382): six naga waves at 57 on Azshara's Southridge
#   Beach, with elite giants close by, for 600 XP, and a flight, a long ride
#   and a hearth.
#   Winterfall Activity (6241): no longer in the game; 8464, which the
#   route takes, replaced it.
# - Winterfall Firewater (5083) and Falling to Corruption (5084) are taken
#   (0.3.7): the Empty Firewater Flask drops from one Winterfall kill in ten
#   (Forever's loot data and the server's loot table agree), and the hot
#   springs alone take 24 of them. Optional: Winterfall Ritual Totem
#   (8471): the totem drops at 2-4%, and Kernda in Timbermaw Hold speaks
#   only to characters at Neutral, which the route does not reach.
# - Not taken: Guarding Secrets (4882, 4883, to Nara Wildmane here). The
#   Blue-feathered Necklace that starts it drops from Winterspring's
#   Moontouched and Berserk Owlbeasts only after Wild Guardians (4741) is
#   done, and 4741 is not even accepted until 05-eastern-plaguelands.
#
# Left open for later guides: The Everlook Report (6029) and Duke Nicholas
# Zverenhoff (6030, Plaguelands), A Strange One (6605), Runecloth (6031: keep
# 30 Runecloth for Meilosh), Wild Guardians (4521, Trull in Felwood), Falling
# to Corruption (5084) and Winterfall Ritual Totem (8471, both in Felwood),
# The Videre Elixir (3909, back to Donova), Are We There, Yeti? (5163: the
# goblins in Tanaris and Un'Goro), Rabine Saturna (1123, Moonglade) and the
# cloth donations.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Everlook

step Everlook
  tip Everlook is the goblin town on the east side of the valley, past the owlbeast hills.
  getfp "Everlook"
  note Gregor's and Harlo's quests lead to other zones: keep them.
  accept 3783                         -- Umi Rumplesnicker
  sethome "Everlook" npc 11118        -- Innkeeper Vizzie: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once
  accept 6029                         -- Gregor Greystone, inside
  accept 6030
  turnin 4808                         -- Felnok Steelspring
  accept 4809

step Ice Thistle yetis
  tip The yeti hills start just south-east of Everlook. Every yeti drops fur; only Matriarchs and Patriarchs drop horns, so keep those for after the turn-in.
  collect 12366 quest 3783

step Umi Rumplesnicker
  turnin 3783
  accept 977

