step Winterfall Village
  tip The furbolg village fills the valley north-east of Everlook. Kill Shamans first; they heal. High Chief Winterfall in the cave at the back is elite: stay out.
  kill 7440 quest 8464.2
  kill 7438 quest 8464.3
  kill 7439 quest 8464.1

